"statement":"ShareLinkViewSet is the declared create entry and uses IsAuthenticated together with PaperlessObjectPermissions.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-b740d736ac7a1cf1","startLine":4696,"endLine":4710}]},{"id":"share-create-permission-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"The POST permission mapping for PaperlessObjectPermissions requires add_sharelink for creation of the ShareLink model.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-07683b2578aff9f7","startLine":36,"endLine":43}]},{"id":"principal-to-serializer-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"PassUserMixin passes request.user into serializers that subclass SerializerWithPerms.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-b740d736ac7a1cf1","startLine":411,"endLine":418}]},{"id":"target-document-resource","kind":"binding","statement":"ShareLinkViewSet binds the ShareLink serializer and its queryset selects the referenced document.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-b740d736ac7a1cf1","startLine":4704,"endLine":4708}]},{"id":"target-document-authorization-control","kind":"control","statement":"Document validation requires the global documents.view_document permission and the owner-aware has_perms_owner_aware check; otherwise it raises PermissionDenied.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-d74dd1895d260a60","startLine":2873,"endLine":2886}]},{"id":"owner-aware-object-check","kind":"control","statement":"The owner-aware check allows an owner or an object-level permission reported by ObjectPermissionChecker, and otherwise returns false.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-07683b2578aff9f7","startLine":624,"endLine":635}]},{"id":"share-link-effect","kind":"effect","statement":"The referenced document must pass serializer validation before the ShareLink serializer creates the share-link object.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-d74dd1895d260a60","startLine":2869,"endLine":2886}]},{"id":"missing-object-view-condition","kind":"condition","statement":"Under the stated premises, the caller is not the document owner and has no object-level view_document grant, so the owner-aware target-document condition is unsatisfied despite the global view_document grant.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-07683b2578aff9f7","startLine":634,"endLine":635}]}],"decisiveMissingFacts":[],"suggestedObservations":[]}]}}],"tokens":{"input":3625,"output":988,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"durationMs":24609.217500000028,"stopReason":"tool_use"},"schemaValidation":{"valid":true,"diagnostics":[]},"endedAt":"2026-09-29T19:16:58.025Z"}}
